  "goodToKnow": "Die Verhältnismäßigkeit is proportionality. In German constitutional law the Grundsatz der Verhältnismäßigkeit requires that a state measure is geeignet (suitable), erforderlich (necessary) and angemessen (appropriate) for its aim. It is a standard test in court rulings and news about security or Covid measures. The adjective is verhältnismäßig, its negative unverhältnismäßig. It has no plural."
